  "description": "Remove line and block comments from C++ source code.",
  "pseudocode": "1. Initialize blocked = false, buffer = empty\n2. For each line in source:\n3.   For i from 0 to line length:\n4.     If !blocked and i+1 < len and line[i..i+1] == '/*': blocked = true, i++\n5.     Else if !blocked and i+1 < len and line[i..i+1] == '//': break\n6.     Else if blocked and i+1 < len and line[i..i+1] == '*/': blocked = false, i++\n7.     Else if !blocked: buffer += line[i]\n8.   If !blocked and buffer not empty: add buffer to result, buffer = empty",
  "steps": [
    {
      "codeLine": 1,
      "note": "Initialize status variables.",
      "array": [
        "/*Test program */",
        "int main()",
        "{ ",
        "  // variable declaration ",
        "int a, b, c;",
        "/*This is a test",
        "   multiline  ",
        "   comment for ",
        "   testing*/",
        "a = b + c;",
        "}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "codeLine": 2,
      "note": "Processing first line '/*Test program */'",
      "array": [
        "/*Test program */"
      ]
    },
    {
      "codeLine": 4,
      "note": "Found '/*'. Set blocked = true.",
      "array": [
        "/*Test program */"
      ]
    },
    {
      "codeLine": 6,
      "note": "Found '*/'. Set blocked = false.",
      "array": [
        "/*Test program */"
      ]
    },
    {
      "codeLine": 8,
      "note": "Blocked is false and buffer is empty. Result remains empty.",
      "array": []
    },
    {
      "codeLine": 7,
      "note": "Processing 'int main()'. Add to buffer.",
      "array": [
        "int main()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "codeLine": 8,
      "note": "Push 'int main()' to result.",
      "array": [
        "int main()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "codeLine": 7,
      "note": "Processing '{ '.",
      "array": [
        "int main()",
        "{"
      ]
    },
    {
      "codeLine": 5,
      "note": "Found '//'. Ignore rest of line.",
      "array": [
        "int main()",
        "{"
      ]
    },
    {
      "codeLine": 7,
      "note": "Processing 'int a, b, c;'. Append to buffer.",
      "array": [
        "int main()",
        "{",
        "int a, b, c;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "codeLine": 4,
      "note": "Found '/*'. Set blocked = true.",
      "array": [
        "int main()",
        "{",
        "int a, b, c;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "codeLine": 6,
      "note": "Found '*/' on line 9. Set blocked = false.",
      "array": [
        "int main()",
        "{",
        "int a, b, c;"
      ],
      "curr": 9
    },
    {
      "codeLine": 7,
      "note": "Processing 'a = b + c;'. Append to buffer.",
      "array": [
        "int main()",
        "{",
        "int a, b, c;",
        "a = b + c;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "codeLine": 8,
      "note": "Processing '}'. Final result.",
      "array": [
        "int main()",
        "{",
        "int a, b, c;",
        "a = b + c;",
        "}"
      ]
    }
  ]
